A||N||14||bHooper||a weekend with Ed Parks and others in NC||||1||
Z||000000||bHooper||02-03-2001||07:42 PM||||i just had to let everyone know that i got to have dinner with Ed and Rosie last night, along with fellow forum member Bob Englert and his wife Lynn and my fiance' Melinda.<P>then today everyone got together in Cary, NC for an informal Fiero meet.<P>what a blast!<P>Ed and Rosie are really nice, boy what a vast amount of knowledge that man has!  Ed was delivering a car to someone in Raleigh, and picking up another "car from hell" to restore.<P>There was 24 people and about a dozen fiero's or so there... it was fun to see all the different cars.  There was even a '84 coupe with a 3800 out of a boneville, getrag and wildwood brakes, racing seats, and no dash... this car was for built for one thing... driving around the race track as fast as possible!  Boy was it neat!<P>Ed and Rosie were headed back to Alabama, afterwards.<P>I would like to thank Bob Englert very much for organizing this event!<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
Z||000001||LZeitgeist||02-03-2001||07:47 PM||||Whoohoo!! Today was a total BLAST!!!!!<P>I couldn't believe how many people showed up... we must have had close to twenty cars there!<P>Thanks, everyone, for showing up - especially the gang from the Greensboro area and farther out... <P>Dad had a great time today, too - he *loved* showing off his white '88 Coupe with the '87 GT fascias on it (the gonna-be Indy II replica...)<P>We can't wait until next month!!!!<P>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>Calvin P. Heinske<BR>1988 White Fiero Coupe<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||RaeQwan||02-03-2001||07:59 PM||||Question, how many of ya'll gonna show up on April 7'th in Rockingham?<P>------------------<BR>Ray - AIM: WookieeNC<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ray19nc/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Fiero Coupe</A> - <A HREF="http://www.CarolinaFieros.com" TARGET=_blank>Carolina Fieros</A> - <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/dearabu/" TARGET=_blank>Dear Abu</A> - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.net" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Network</A>||||reg||1
