Z||000011||FieroLisa||02-05-2001||03:20 PM||||Alright folks- Bob asked me to make up a little website for the group. It's nothing fancy, but hey it's there. The address is <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros</A> <BR>What I need is any person in the group, please email me your website addresses and pics of your cars for the website. If you have any other meeting pics, send them my way too.<BR>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>86 gold 5 speed SC (Sold!)<BR>Columbus, OH/Greensboro NC<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
